WEBVTT

00:14:29.195 --> 00:14:30.614
GA: She would always tell me,

00:14:30.638 --> 00:14:32.257
"I might not leave you anything,

00:14:32.281 --> 00:14:35.569
but I'm going to leave you
a good education."

00:14:35.593 --> 00:14:37.594
AG: Gonzalo got a job
at a local restaurant

00:14:37.618 --> 00:14:39.228
while he applied to colleges.

00:14:39.252 --> 00:14:41.038
GA: When I got the acceptance letter,

00:14:41.062 --> 00:14:44.512
my mom and I were just,
like, jumping and dancing

00:14:44.536 --> 00:14:46.372
and just so happy.

00:14:46.396 --> 00:14:48.734
AG: He headed
to the Ohio State University,

00:14:48.758 --> 00:14:50.695
and it didn't take him long to fit in.

00:14:50.719 --> 00:14:52.330
He was crowned homecoming king,

00:14:52.354 --> 00:14:54.232
started working full time at a bank

00:14:54.256 --> 00:14:55.447
and found a community

00:14:55.471 --> 00:14:58.066
within the Hispanic Business
Student Association.

00:14:58.090 --> 00:15:00.741
They sponsored a trip
to a conference in Washington.